OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be a dry day. Mostly
OL,6,Fcloudy in the morning but this
OL,7,Fthinning and breaking to allow more in
OL,8,Fthe way of bright or sunny intervals
OL,9,Fin the afternoon. Fresh southeasterly
OL,10,Fwind.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FRemaining dry with a few
OL,13,Fclear intervals though cloud will
OL,14,Fthicken up again overnight. Moderate
OL,15,Fto fresh southeasterly winds. Quite
OL,16,Fmild.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
