OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FA mostly dry day although
OL,6,Fstill with a fair amount of cloud.
OL,7,FThere could be the odd spot of rain
OL,8,Fover western counties later. Fresh
OL,9,Fsoutheasterly wind.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FA wet
OL,12,Fwindy start on Tuesday then drying up
OL,13,Fwinds easing. Mostly dry on Wednesday
OL,14,Fand Thursday then rain likely later
OL,15,FThursday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
